# Historical archive is kept in git; generic ignore rules above still exclude logs, caches, and other generated files inside it.

# Temporary status/build files (to prevent future clutter)
*_STATUS.md
*_COMPLETE.md
*_PROGRESS.md
*_SUMMARY.md
DEPLOY_*.md
DEPLOYMENT_*_STATUS.md
BUILD_*.md
FIXES_*.md
WORKAROUND*.md
*QUICK_FIX*.md
*GITPOD*.md
*GITPOD*.txt
START_HERE.md
COPY_THIS_COMMAND.txt

# Test execution reports (keep only source test files)
TEST_EXECUTION_*.csv
TEST_EXECUTION_*.md
*TEST_RESULTS.csv
*TEST_COMPLETE.md
TESTING_COMPLETE*.md
*_TEST_REPORT.md

# Weekly/Phase tracking (after project completion)
PHASE*_COMPLETE.md
PHASE*_PROGRESS.md
PHASE*_ROADMAP.md
WEEK*_*.md

# Enhancement tracking (after implementation)
ENHANCEMENT-*_*.md
ENHANCEMENTS_*.md

# Temporary scripts
debug_*.py
execute_*_tests.py
add_mlops_*.py
merge_*.py
convert_*.py
create_tracking_*.py
test_complete_*.py

# Blueprint generation artifacts
*_BLUEPRINT_*.docx
*_BLUEPRINT_*.pdf
*_Blueprint_*.md

# Large flow diagrams (keep in docs/ only)
*_FLOW_DIAGRAM.md
*_FLOWS.md
*_INTEGRATION*.md
